M3-c140 L08 C 
  F: In Lab 1, what are the absolute cosines between the planted level, slope and curvature shapes and their best-matching components? 
  B: 0.9994 for level (PC1), 0.9985 for slope (PC2) and 0.9990 for curvature (PC3) (Lab 1 output). The three matches are distinct. They describe the planted panel only. 
